  DisplayName: Depth Charge
  Description: 'Orcas only - a raid on the rival forest. The arena is a grown forest in every colour,
    and every rival prism your team breaks counts: fly a missile into a plant, throw the
    bomb into a cluster, and let the guns pick at what is left. Your own colour is not your
    score but it is your cover. Omni crystals reload every gunner seat. Higher intensities
    thin the forest. First team to the target wins.'
